# 24. What if method1 has no `@Transactional`?

Suppose:

```java
public void method1() {

    method2();
}

@Transactional
public void method2() {
}
```

If `method2()` is called through a Spring proxy:

```text
method1
   |
   v
method2
   |
   | @Transactional
   |
   | BEGIN TX-1
   |
   v
method2 work
   |
